OL,3,AThe rising cost of putting food on the
OL,4,Atable in India
OL,5,
OL,6,FIndia's inflation is rising again. And
OL,7,Fthe biggest worry is what's happening
OL,8,Fto food prices.
OL,10,FThe latest government data shows retail
OL,11,Finflation climbed to 6.09% in October,
OL,12,Fup from 5.54% in September.
OL,14,FBut look more closely at food
OL,15,Finflation. It has surged to 8.94%.
OL,17,FThe squeeze was sharper in rural India,
OL,18,Fwhere food inflation was 9.09%,
OL,19,Fcompared with 8.68% in urban areas.
